# Everything the app generates or caches lives here, and some of it is a
# provider's index of real client names. Ignore the directory wholesale rather
# than listing file types — the *.db rules that used to be here were correct as
# far as they went, and clio_matters.json still slipped through by being JSON.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep

